Per-depth recall reveals convergent failure: OBD achieves 96\% at depth-0 but only 14--22\% at depths 2--4; GPT-5.5 achieves 77\% (depth-0), 8--38\% (depths 2--4); Claude: 69\% (depth-0), 10--37\% (depths 2--4).
